  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8214;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8214;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>Dr&#39;s of normal to the plane containing&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> will be proportional to :&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd><mtd><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7a89a7b3-39a0-4765-9643-1eefe6731e6e-image.png\" style=\"width: 213px; height: 164px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#8467;</mi><mn>0</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>For point, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">A</mi></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#8594;</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>11</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#177;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>121</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>49</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>171</mn></msqrt></math> or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>81</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>131</mn></msqrt></math></p>",
